{"metadata":{"symbolKind":"property","title":"allowedCountries","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"allowedCountries"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@ScanbotSDK@objc(cs)SBSDKEuropeanHealthInsuranceCardIssuingCountry","text":"SBSDKEuropeanHealthInsuranceCardIssuingCountry","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","modules":[{"name":"ScanbotSDK"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"allowedCountries"}],"externalID":"c:@M@ScanbotSDK@objc(cs)SBSDKEuropeanHealthInsuranceCardRecognizerConfiguration(py)allowedCountries"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@objc","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"allowedCountries","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@ScanbotSDK@objc(cs)SBSDKEuropeanHealthInsuranceCardIssuingCountry","identifier":"doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/documentation\/ScanbotSDK\/SBSDKEuropeanHealthInsuranceCardIssuingCountry","text":"SBSDKEuropeanHealthInsuranceCardIssuingCountry","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"single country: validation rules for the given country are used starting from the first","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"frame. If the country cannot be inferred or the inferred country doesn’t","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"match the given country, the result of recognize() will be IncompleteValidation."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"multiple countries: the country is inferred from the card number first.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Until the country is detected, the document fields are not OCR’d and"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"accumulated. Once the country is inferred, the field accumulation starts"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and the inferred country validation rules are applied."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"If the country cannot be inferred or the inferred country doesn’t match"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"any of the countries in the list, the result status will be IncompleteValidation."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"empty list: same as “multiple countries” with one additional detail.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If the country cannot be inferred within ","type":"text"},{"code":"maxCountryDetectionAttempts","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" successive frames in which the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"part of the card number that stores the country code was successfully OCR’d, then the country is","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"inferred to be Unknown and no validation rules are applied. Field accumulation then proceeds normally.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"In this case recognize() can eventually return Success and the document will have a CountryType of Unknown.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/scanbotsdk\/sbsdkeuropeanhealthinsurancecardrecognizerconfiguration\/allowedcountries"]},{"paths":["\/documentation\/scanbotsdk\/sbsdkeuropeanhealthinsurancecardrecognizerconfiguration\/allowedcountries"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/documentation\/ScanbotSDK","doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/documentation\/ScanbotSDK